<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Hylsamex 9-mo net triples.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Hylsamex 9-mo net triples.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>-</p>
<p>				    1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper ln		1.053 bln</p>
<p>	Net profit	1.694 bln		552.5 million</p>
<p>	Revs		6.772 bln		5.971 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Hylsamex SA, the steel unit of Mexica Grupo Industrial Alfa.</p>
<p>Hylsamex added it had a 9-month integral finance gain of 775.6 million pesos against a cost of 416.8 million pesos in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289530</p>
